,53,-1,1,"You probably just need to get the call OnIconChanged on the model's delegate here."],["9ac06dac_0c2bd71a",54,-1,1,"Seems like when we update the icon on the model, onIconChanged() should be called which should update the menu_item_view? Can you check if we need the callback and this function?"],["bf18bf7f_036f4974",53,-1,0,"Still don't think this should change between calls since we only call it here."],["2b9f1a7d_f8069520",55,0,1,"You don't need both of these delegate classes. You already have ui::MenuModelDelegate where you override OnIconChanged."],["7f96ee96_95014e4a",53,0,1,"Probably don't need this anymore?"],["b31b2e2f_b7e46c61",55,0,1,"Nit/optional: This is still a string16."]],0,159],[7122318,20397,51,1.341,1.058,[[0,48]],[["0e5af3b5_7d239dc6",53,0,1,"I'm not sure if we should construct a mojom object here just to call the handler. That seems like the same amount of steps just creating an object for an interface that we will not be using plus…"],["871e9179_98f7340f",53,0,1,"Should probably get these after we verify the tab is valid."],["95f0bd30_c61f212c",53,0,0,"Do we use tab_id?"],["dcf9d3b5_19a2e4cd",55,0,1,"Doesn't seem like you need this here? Move it to the .cc file if we do end up going this way."]],0,160],[7128960,20402,194,4.21,3.407,[[0,49]],[["086e5426_2c955d91",56,0,1,"Do you need this?"],["c51f15ff_a398a3d9",53,0,1,"nit: Not sure if this should be true or false. Need to figure out how we can determine if the button was clicked from keyboard or mouse."],["c96c6774_02b27bda",53,0,1,"Why did you change this to false?"],["dbc41d55_afa1b61f",55,0,1,"Shouldn't need this. It's already forward declared. If you need it in the cc, include it there."],["e72c48a2_5b82d5b2",53,0,1,"Remove comment."],["f673b105_bc24dfc2",53,0,0,"Should probably pass this to the popup file selector but we can leave that for later."]],0,161],[7142858,20403,129,4.21,3.407,[[0,50]],[["4c99da97_a0ea9bbf",57,0,0,"Is this not null? We haven't added any context."],["e58acf